# Optional. Everything has a safe default; the lab needs no tenant and no credentials (it holds none, for any cloud or provider).
# The shared settings file is ~/Development/.env (mode 600; STANDALONE_ENV overrides the path), read by every standalone app.
# This lab reads one optional key from it:
# AGL_LAB_MODE=mock               # the mode the page opens in: mock (default) or live (both loopback-only, no outbound network)
# Per-run settings (shell, not the shared file; the shared file holds no PORT):
# PORT=7300                       # must be in 7300-7349
# AGLAB_BIND=127.0.0.1            # loopback only unless you set this on purpose (the container does)
